repository-code: https://github.com/guillem-ps/policy-pattern
repository-artifact: https://pypi.org/project/policy-pattern/
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: >
  policy-pattern is a minimal, embeddable ReBAC (relationship-based
  access control) engine for Python, in the spirit of Google Zanzibar.
  It models authorization as a graph of relationships between subjects
  and objects instead of flat roles, ships as a standalone in-process
  library with no required server or network dependency, and treats
  storage semantics as a documented, testable contract shared across
  adapters.
keywords:
  - python
  - authorization
  - access-control
  - rebac
  - zanzibar
  - security
